Section 3.2 Definitions how we define
problems directly impacts

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:11,279
which strategies we pursue in solving that
problem. In

3
00:00:11,279 --> 00:00:14,880
a new and evolving field like AI safety,
clearly

4
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:18,960
defined terms are essential for effective
communication and research.

5
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:25,839
Ambiguity leads to miscommunication,
hinders collaboration, obscures
disagreements, and

6
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:30,219
facilitates safety. Washington the terms
we use reflect our

7
00:00:30,219 --> 00:00:32,859
assumptions about the nature of the
problems we're trying

8
00:00:32,859 --> 00:00:36,659
to solve and shape the solutions we
develop. Terms

9
00:00:36,659 --> 00:00:40,939
like alignment and safety are used with
